# NI's proprietary files (manual, firmware updaters, installer image, the unmodified stock firmware): local only, never committed.
# Patched images, the carved stock image, decompressed RAM data and decompilations contain NI code too: keep them out of the repo (scratch directories are fine).
/proprietary/
*.bin
*.dmg
*.app/
MM3*Updater*
*.ghidra
*.gpr
*.rep/

# local tooling and editor state
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv*/
node_modules/
